
@InsurancePortalRegistration_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Validate policyholder information
POST {{InsurancePortalRegistration_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/validate-policyholder
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json

{
  "ssn": "7777",
  "policyNumber": "VA7777777",
  "firstName": "Monica",
  "lastName": "Geller",
  "dateOfBirth": "06/18/1990",
  "zipCode": "99501"
}
###

### Check current authenticated user
GET {{InsurancePortalRegistration_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/me
Accept: application/json

###

### Log out
POST {{InsurancePortalRegistration_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
Accept: application/json

###

### Log in
POST {{InsurancePortalRegistration_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "YOUR_TEST_USERNAME",
  "password": "YOUR_TEST_PASSWORD"
}

###
